@startuml
actor Automation as A
participant CLI
participant discover_commands
participant autoplan_module as Autoplan
participant semantic_preview as SemanticPreview

A -> CLI: sirius autoplan
CLI -> discover_commands: discover_commands()
discover_commands --> CLI: CommandSpec list
CLI -> Autoplan: load module & call main()
Autoplan -> SemanticPreview: generate suggestions
SemanticPreview --> Autoplan: suggestions
Autoplan --> CLI: exit code / outputs plan
CLI --> A: return status and artifacts
@enduml
